00:34:36.841 --> 00:34:39.811
So there it is twined with
identity politics, right?

00:34:39.811 --> 00:34:42.180
Blexit is twined with it.

00:34:42.180 --> 00:34:44.082 align:start size:84% position:16%
And I always say, when
people ask me this,

00:34:44.082 --> 00:34:46.684
