identity politics.

00:34:53.057 --> 00:34:55.026
So I am happy to be black.

00:34:55.026 --> 00:34:56.594
I think black can
be an identity.

00:34:56.594 --> 00:34:58.196 align:start size:81% position:19%
I think Jewish can
be an identity.

00:34:58.196 --> 00:35:00.898 align:start position:0%
I think a part of your identity
can be if I was pregnant

00:35:00.898 --> 00:35:04.368
and I wanted to take
a class and sit around

00:35:04.368 --> 00:35:05.870
