00:35:05.870 --> 00:35:07.171 align:start size:97% position:3%
and talk about the struggles
that we're going through,

00:35:07.171 --> 00:35:09.073
that's not identity politics,

00:35:09.073 --> 00:35:10.341
that's all of us coming together

00:35:10.341 --> 00:35:12.243
because we share a
certain identity.

00:35:12.243 --> 00:35:14.045 align:start size:84% position:16%
And we're talking
about certain things

00:35:14.045 --> 00:35:15.480
that are relevant to us,

00:35:15.480 --> 00:35:17.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
