to talk about things

00:35:17.014 --> 00:35:18.950
that are relevant for them
is not identity politics.

00:35:18.950 --> 00:35:22.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I was using Blexit
and at our Blexit events,

00:35:22.286 --> 00:35:25.490
