00:35:27.525 --> 00:35:29.527
and start being a Republican.

00:35:29.527 --> 00:35:31.429
That would be identity politics

00:35:31.429 --> 00:35:33.097 align:start size:84% position:16%
because of the
color of your skin.

00:35:33.097 --> 00:35:34.332
It's quite the opposite.

00:35:34.332 --> 00:35:36.400
We're talking about why
the color of our skin

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:39.303 align:start size:97% position:3%
and the dialogue, and the
race dialogue is meaningless.

00:35:39.303 --> 00:35:41.205
We're talking about
taking responsibility

00:35:41.205 --> 00:35:46.210
for things that are going
on amongst our communities

00:35:47.612 --> 00:35:49.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we have been the
perpetuators of, you know,

00:35:49.013 --> 00:35:50.882 align:start size:97% position:3%
we talk about police
brutality in a real context,

00:35:50.882 --> 00:35:53.484
we talk about that weighed
