01:21:26.815 --> 01:21:28.316
They wanna eat a bunch.

01:21:28.316 --> 01:21:29.951
They're laughing,
they watch movies,

01:21:29.951 --> 01:21:32.687
but definitely not going
out and committing crimes

01:21:32.687 --> 01:21:34.623
and things of that nature.

01:21:34.623 --> 01:21:35.757 align:start size:84% position:16%
I think the
conservative argument

01:21:35.757 --> 01:21:37.292
