01:21:37.292 --> 01:21:38.226
I think I've heard a
lot of people say that.

01:21:38.226 --> 01:21:39.594
- They love that argument.

01:21:39.594 --> 01:21:41.263
- And I just where I have--

01:21:41.263 --> 01:21:42.564 align:start position:0%
- But then it's like, well,
alcohol is a gateway drug also.

01:21:42.564 --> 01:21:44.065
