01:22:12.527 --> 01:22:14.562 align:start size:84% position:16%
- You had one good
year in there though--

01:22:14.562 --> 01:22:15.397
- My wedding year.

01:22:15.397 --> 01:22:17.832
(indistinct chatting)

01:22:17.832 --> 01:22:19.334
- We had a good time.

01:22:19.334 --> 01:22:20.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
- You can't not drink when
you're getting married.

01:22:20.969 --> 01:22:22.203
'Cause everybody
