01:22:23.471 --> 01:22:25.206
until you get married.

01:22:25.206 --> 01:22:26.841
But so I am saying that,

01:22:26.841 --> 01:22:28.677
I'm seeing him drink
this glass of wine

01:22:28.677 --> 01:22:30.345
and I'm wondering how
he's reconciling it.

01:22:30.345 --> 01:22:32.280
And he says, oh, well
this is different.

01:22:32.280 --> 01:22:33.915
Well, tell me how
it's different.

01:22:33.915 --> 01:22:35.951
Well, alcohol, it's
different for me.

01:22:35.951 --> 01:22:37.719 align:start size:84% position:16%
If I'm drinking
alcohol at my house.

01:22:37.719 --> 01:22:39.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm like, well, that's
exactly their argument

01:22:39.754 --> 01:22:40.855
for smoking pot.

01:22:40.855 --> 01:22:42.324
And I said, naturally,

01:22:42.324 --> 01:22:44.225 align:start size:97% position:3%
if you wanna talk about having
a worse impact on society,

01:22:44.225 --> 01:22:46.127
