01:22:46.127 --> 01:22:48.229 align:start size:97% position:3%
People get drunk, they go
home, they beat their wives.

01:22:48.229 --> 01:22:49.931
They party, they make mistakes.

01:22:49.931 --> 01:22:51.833
You know, it is a gateway drug.

01:22:51.833 --> 01:22:53.468
- Car accident.
- Car accidents.

01:22:53.468 --> 01:22:54.970
The car accident
happened from DUIs,

01:22:54.970 --> 01:22:56.838
which is higher than by the way,

01:22:56.838 --> 01:22:58.773 align:start size:84% position:16%
people that are killed
by guns every year.

01:22:58.773 --> 01:23:00.308
Look at the deaths
by motor vehicles.

01:23:00.308 --> 01:23:02.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nobody's talking about
taking people's cars away.

01:23:02.410 --> 01:23:04.179
We don't want to
give in our cars.

01:23:05.113 --> 01:23:06.614
But so I said that to him

01:23:06.614 --> 01:23:08.883 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I think he was starting
to see, I was like,

01:23:08.883 --> 01:23:10.285 align:start size:84% position:16%
if you're gonna
make that argument,

01:23:10.285 --> 01:23:12.420
you need to make the
argument more soundly

01:23:12.420 --> 01:23:14.189
because you either are a person

01:23:14.189 --> 01:23:15.790
that believes that
there should be...

01:23:15.790 --> 01:23:17.225
You abstain from everything,

01:23:17.225 --> 01:23:19.928 align:start size:97% position:3%
and that society is just
better off without everything.

01:23:19.928 --> 01:23:22.297 align:start position:0%
Or if you're saying that people
should have the, you know,

01:23:22.297 --> 01:23:25.467 align:start size:97% position:3%
the right, the personal
right to engage in drinking

01:23:25.467 --> 01:23:27.268
and getting blacked
out drunk at bars

01:23:27.268 --> 01:23:30.005
so long as they don't
drive themselves home,

01:23:30.005 --> 01:23:32.774 align:start size:84% position:16%
