regressive results

01:35:35.763 --> 01:35:37.732 align:start size:88% position:13%
for the black community
first and foremost.

01:35:37.732 --> 01:35:42.737
And so I am loathed
to be smart enough

01:35:44.138 --> 01:35:47.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
