01:36:46.700 --> 01:36:50.471
Look back at your ancestors,
look back at your grandparents,

01:36:50.471 --> 01:36:52.873
look back at what they did,
what they lived through,

01:36:52.873 --> 01:36:54.975 align:start size:97% position:3%
the seeds that they planted,
so that you can afford

01:36:54.975 --> 01:36:57.178
to be in the circumstance
that you are in today.

01:36:57.178 --> 01:36:58.445
If you are a black American

01:36:58.445 --> 01:37:00.748
and you are breathing in
the United States today,

01:37:00.748 --> 01:37:03.584
you are the luckiest, among
the luckiest of Black people

01:37:03.584 --> 01:37:06.921
that have ever lived anywhere
on the face of the planet.

01:37:06.921 --> 01:37:08.389
That is an incredible statement.

01:37:08.389 --> 01:37:10.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
All of human history,
the luckiest Black people

01:37:10.191 --> 01:37:12.393
that have ever lived on the
face of the human planet

01:37:12.393 --> 01:37:15.095
are the ones that are living
and breathing in America today.

01:37:15.095 --> 01:37:17.464
Okay, if you understand that

01:37:17.464 --> 01:37:19.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
