your US citizenship

01:37:40.855 --> 01:37:42.256 align:start size:81% position:19%
for you to go live
back in Africa.

01:37:42.256 --> 01:37:43.657
- You want a cap this
to maybe 10 people

01:37:43.657 --> 01:37:44.825
just in case people
