01:37:47.828 --> 01:37:49.196
I hate America.

01:37:49.196 --> 01:37:50.898
Everyone offered them
money and flights.

01:37:50.898 --> 01:37:52.766 align:start size:84% position:16%
I think you might
have, Don might have,

01:37:52.766 --> 01:37:54.501
