01:38:01.141 --> 01:38:03.544
I'll guarantee one
first class upgrade.

01:38:03.544 --> 01:38:04.845
- That's amazing.
- I will do that.

01:38:04.845 --> 01:38:05.679
- There we go right here,

01:38:05.679 --> 01:38:07.181
one first class upgrade.

01:38:07.181 --> 01:38:09.216
To leave America but you have
