01:38:30.738 --> 01:38:33.207
And then evil white men
came with their guns.

01:38:33.207 --> 01:38:35.276
- Wait you're telling me
Wakanda is not a place?

01:38:36.710 --> 01:38:39.880
- This is really what the
story has come down to.

01:38:39.880 --> 01:38:44.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
When in fact we were sold
by our own ancestors.

01:38:44.051 --> 01:38:45.986
We were already living
in terrible situations.

01:38:45.986 --> 01:38:46.921
We were already slaves.

01:38:46.921 --> 01:38:48.622
We were already being enslaved.

01:38:48.622 --> 01:38:50.691
We were enslaved
first by the Arabs.

01:38:50.691 --> 01:38:53.027 align:start size:88% position:13%
The Arabs were the first
two enslave Africans.

01:38:53.027 --> 01:38:55.496
And we were sold for
things as meaningless.

01:38:55.496 --> 01:38:58.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
Talk about how, how
tribal their society was.

01:38:58.165 --> 01:38:59.700
We were sold for gin.

01:38:59.700 --> 01:39:01.135
We were sold from mirrors.

01:39:01.135 --> 01:39:03.737
Imagine Africa look a mirror.

01:39:03.737 --> 01:39:06.507
Oh, I'll take 20 of
my strongest men.

01:39:06.507 --> 01:39:07.441
Thanks for the mirror.

01:39:07.441 --> 01:39:09.476
Take 20 of my strongest men.

01:39:09.476 --> 01:39:10.978
These are the reasons
that we were sold.

01:39:10.978 --> 01:39:14.615
This is how tribal and how
backwards their society was.

01:39:14.615 --> 01:39:15.749
Take ownership of that.

01:39:15.749 --> 01:39:16.951
Take ownership of the fact that

01:39:16.951 --> 01:39:19.019 align:start size:84% position:16%
when you look at
human history, I mean,

01:39:19.019 --> 01:39:21.755 align:start position:0%
you look at all of the horrible
things that have happened,

01:39:21.755 --> 01:39:23.857 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
nobody's guiltless,
least of all,

01:39:23.857 --> 01:39:25.059 line:0%
people that are in Africa

01:39:25.059 --> 01:39:27.161 line:0%
because today the slave
trade still goes on.

01:39:27.161 --> 01:39:30.164 line:0%
