01:40:15.376 --> 01:40:19.013
and while certainly wasn't
in the circumstance back then

01:40:19.013 --> 01:40:20.814
it is today that
it was a blessing.

01:40:20.814 --> 01:40:22.449
In the retrospect,
it was a blessing

01:40:22.449 --> 01:40:26.120
that we got out of Africa and
that we are in America today,

01:40:26.120 --> 01:40:28.555
which is why so many of Africans

01:40:28.555 --> 01:40:32.292 align:start size:88% position:13%
